---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Lab — Vinith Reddy Banda" description="Small experiments in canvas physics, real-time presence and interface interaction.">
<section class="lab-shell page-shell">
  <div class="lab-head"><div class="intro-overline"><span>EXPERIMENTS / 2026</span><span>OPEN FOR EXPLORATION</span></div><h1>The <em>lab.</em></h1><p>A few working studies in interaction and browser behaviour. Touch around.</p></div>
  <article class="lab-entry" id="dots"><div class="lab-entry-meta"><span>01 / CANVAS</span><span>PHYSICS · POINTER</span></div><div class="lab-entry-main"><h2>Polka<br /><em>dots.</em></h2><p>A field of tiny points, held in place by springs. Move through it and the dots scatter, swell and settle. Click to send a ripple across the field.</p></div><div class="lab-entry-foot"><span>MOVE YOUR CURSOR ANYWHERE ON THE PAGE</span><span>SPRING / REPEL / RIPPLE</span></div></article>
  <article class="lab-entry" id="presence"><div class="lab-entry-meta"><span>02 / NETWORK</span><span>WEBSOCKET · REAL TIME</span></div><div class="lab-entry-main"><h2>Live<br /><em>presence.</em></h2><p>Visitors appear as moving cursors, with positions shared between connected sessions. The live relay is enabled when the presence Worker is deployed.</p></div><div class="lab-entry-foot"><span>CONNECTED VISITORS <b data-lab-visitors>01</b></span><span>STATUS / <b data-lab-status>LOCAL ONLY</b></span></div></article>
  <article class="lab-entry" id="press"><div class="lab-entry-meta"><span>03 / SPATIAL UI</span><span>3D · GESTURE</span></div><div class="lab-entry-main"><h2>Project<br /><em>press.</em></h2><p>A rotating ring of project plates. Drag, flick or use the wheel to move through the work. Switch to grid and the same plates find a new layout.</p></div><div class="lab-entry-foot"><a href="/">TRY IT ON THE FRONT PAGE ↗</a><span>DEPTH / INERTIA / FLIP</span></div></article>
</section>
</BaseLayout>